# Vain (Windurst 8-1, mission.windurst.vain), the northern zone-ins (the Ronfaures, La Theine, Batallia, Beaucedine,
# Xarcabard, Konschtat, Valkurm). Status 1 (a GM): each zone-in plays its event, left open; its update sends the sky
# (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, n) the position or the zone before picks, or nothing; the finish closes it. A warp to 0,0,0 is 1,0,1
# (a zone's onZoneIn sets a char at 0,0,0 down at its own spot); a warp inside a zone keeps the zone before it.
# Valkurm's inner 3 arm stays unreached (kept: z above 45 is above -301).
